"},{"surface":"சீறூர்","parts":[{"text":"சீறூர்","lemma":"cīṟūr","gloss":"small village"}],"gloss":"small village"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒலி","parts":[{"text":"ஒலி","lemma":"oli","gloss":"thick"}],"gloss":"thick"},{"surface":"மென்","parts":[{"text":"மென்","lemma":"men","gloss":"soft"}],"gloss":"soft"},{"surface":"கூந்தல்","parts":[{"text":"கூந்தல்","lemma":"kūntal","gloss":"hair"}],"gloss":"hair"},{"surface":"ஒள்","parts":[{"text":"ஒள்","lemma":"oḷ","gloss":"bright"}],"gloss":"bright"},{"surface":"நுதல்","parts":[{"text":"நுதல்","lemma":"nutal","gloss":"forehead"}],"gloss":"forehead"},{"surface":"அரிவை","parts":[{"text":"அரிவை","lemma":"arivai","gloss":"woman"}],"gloss":"woman"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நடுகல்","parts":[{"text":"நடுகல்","lemma":"naṭukal","gloss":"hero stone"}],"gloss":"hero stone"},{"surface":"கைதொழுது","parts":[{"text":"கை","lemma":"kai","gloss":"hand"},{"text":"தொழுது","lemma":"toḻutu","gloss":"worshipping"}],"gloss":"worshipping with folded hands"},{"surface":"பரவும்","parts":[{"text":"பரவும்","lemma":"paravu","gloss":"praises"}],"gloss":"praises"},{"surface":"ஒடியாது","parts":[{"text":"ஒடியாது","lemma":"oṭiyātu","gloss":"without ceasing"}],"gloss":"without ceasing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விருந்து","parts":[{"text":"விருந்து","lemma":"viruntu","gloss":"guest"}],"gloss":"guest"},{"surface":"எதிர்","parts":[{"text":"எதிர்","lemma":"etir","gloss":"to welcome"}],"gloss":"to welcome"},{"surface":"பெறுக","parts":[{"text":"பெறுக","lemma":"peṟu","gloss":"may receive"}],"gloss":"may receive"},{"surface":"தில்","parts":[{"text":"தில்","lemma":"til","gloss":"particle of desire"}],"gloss":"particle of desire"},{"surface":"யானே","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"yāṉ","gloss":"I"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"I indeed"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"ஐயும்","parts":[{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ai","gloss":"lord"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and my lord"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒ","parts":[{"text":"ஒ","lemma":"o","gloss":"oh"}],"gloss":"oh"},{"surface":"…","parts":[{"text":"…","lemma":"…","gloss":"gap"}],"gloss":"gap"},{"surface":"வேந்தனொடு","parts":[{"text":"வேந்தன்","lemma":"vēntaṉ","gloss":"king"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"oṭu","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the king"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நாடு","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"nāṭu","gloss":"country"}],"gloss":"country"},{"surface":"தரு","parts":[{"text":"தரு","lemma":"taru","gloss":"giving"}],"gloss":"giving"},{"surface":"விழு","parts":[{"text":"விழு","lemma":"viḻu","gloss":"great"}],"gloss":"great"},{"surface":"பகை","parts":[{"text":"பகை","lemma":"pakai","gloss":"enmity"}],"gloss":"enmity"},{"surface":"எய்துக","parts":[{"text":"எய்துக","lemma":"eytu","gloss":"may attain"}],"gloss":"may attain"},{"surface":"எனவே","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"eṉa","gloss":"thus"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"thus indeed"}]}],"literal":"Elephant to clash shaken thorny fence of kḻal shrub / scarce to drink well of beautiful settlement small village / thick soft hair bright forehead woman / hero stone hands worshipping praises without ceasing / \"Guests to welcome may I receive! My lord too / oh ... with the king / country-yielding great enmity may he attain!\" thus.","translation":"In the small, beautiful village with a scarce-water well and a thorny fence shaken by clashing elephants, a woman with thick, soft hair and a bright forehead worships the hero stone with folded hands, praying without fail: \"May I receive guests to welcome! And may my lord, fighting alongside the king, encounter great enemies to win lands!\"","modern":"யானைகள் மோதியதால் குலைந்துபோன கழற்செடியின் முள்வேலியையும், நீர் குடிப்பதற்கு அரிதான கிணற்றையும் உடைய அழகிய குடியிருப்பு கொண்ட சிறிய ஊரில் வாழும், அடர்த்தியான மென்மையான கூந்தலையும் ஒளிரும் நெற்றியையும் கொண்ட பெண், நடுகல்லைக் கைகூப்பித் தொழுது, இடைவிடாது இவ்வாறு வேண்டுகிறாள்: \"நான் விருந்தினர்களை வரவேற்று உபசரிக்கும் பேற்றைப் பெற வேண்டும்; என் தலைவனும் வேந்தனுடன் சென்று, அவனுக்கு நாட்டைப் பெற்றுத் தரும் பெரும் பகைவர்களை எதிர்கொண்டு வெல்ல வேண்டும்.\"","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Vākai tiṇai and Mūtiṉ Mullai tuṟai, which extols the ancient, brave lineage of warriors. The poet Aḷḷūr Naṉmullaiyār depicts a brave housewife of a small, rugged village praying before a hero stone (naṭukal) erected for a fallen warrior. Instead of asking for wealth or personal safety, she prays for two things: the opportunity to host guests (hospitality being a supreme virtue) and for her husband to face mighty enemies in battle to win lands for his king. The imagery of the village—with its thorny fence shaken by wild elephants and a deep, scarce-water well—reflects the harsh, heroic landscape of the dry forest region, mirroring the tough, unyielding nature of its inhabitants. Key words include 'naṭukal' (hero stone), 'viruntu' (guest), and 'viḻuppakai' (great enmity/mighty foe).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,0.97],[1.0,1.75],[1.75,2.0],[2.0,2.49],[2.49,2.78],[2.84,3.33],[3.33,3.7],[3.7,4.25],[4.25,4.8],[4.8,5.4],[5.4,5.7],[5.7,6.5],[6.5,6.7],[6.7,7.3],[7.3,7.7],[7.7,8.9],[8.9,9.23],[9.23,9.7],[9.7,10.07],[10.2,10.7],[10.7,10.79],[10.79,11.24],[11.4,12.8],[12.8,13.24],[13.4,13.64],[13.7,14.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.07],[1.1,2.05],[2.05,2.3],[2.3,3.0],[3.0,3.2],[3.3,4.1],[4.1,4.5],[4.5,5.05],[5.05,5.6],[5.6,6.3],[6.3,6.6],[6.6,7.7],[7.7,7.9],[7.9,8.6],[8.8,9.4],[9.4,10.39],[10.39,10.83],[10.83,11.57],[11.57,11.86],[11.86,12.6],[12.6,12.86],[12.86,14.16],[14.16,14.7],[14.7,15.36],[15.36,15.9],[15.9,16.3]]},"sync":[[["களிறு","male elephant"],["பொர","to fight"],["கலங்கு","being stirred"]],[["கலங்கு","being stirred"]],[["கழல்","Molucca bean shrub"],["முள்","thorn"]],[["வேலி","fence"]],[["அரிது","scarce"],["உண்","to drink"]],[["கூவல்","well"]],[["அம்","beautiful"],["குடி","settlement"],["சீறூர்","small village"]],[["சீறூர்","small village"]],[["ஒலி","thick"],["மென்","soft"]],[["கூந்தல்","hair"]],[["ஒள்","bright"],["நுதல்","forehead"]],[["அரிவை","woman"]],[["நடுகல்","hero stone"]],[["கைதொழுது","worshipping with folded hands"]],[["பரவும்","praises"]],[["ஒடியாது","without ceasing"]],[["விருந்து","guest"]],[["எதிர்","to welcome"]],[["பெறுக","may receive"],["தில்","particle of desire"]],[["யானே","I indeed"]],[["என்","my"],["ஐயும்","and my lord"]],[["ஒ","oh"]],[["வேந்தனொடு","with the king"]],[["நாடு","country"],["தரு","giving"]],[["விழு","great"],["பகை","enmity"]],[["எய்துக","may attain"]],[["எனவே","thus indeed"]]]}